# Optional. Used only by `npm run stats` (which runs before every build).
#
#   - raises the GitHub REST rate limit from 60 to 5000 req/hr
#   - unlocks the trailing-year contribution total shown in the work section,
#     private-repo work included; without it that stat falls back to the
#     account's join year
#
# Classic PAT with the `read:user` scope, or a fine-grained token with read
# access to your profile. No write scopes are needed.
#
# Copy to .env for local builds. For deploys, set it as a build environment
# variable in the hosting dashboard — never commit the real value.
GITHUB_TOKEN=
